fi","c":16},{"lap":3,"text":"Wimille takes the lead from Moll, Gaupillat follows.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":4,"text":"The first big name was Etancelin with a broken axle on his Monza, followed by Moll.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":22},{"lap":5,"text":"22 minutes into the race Falchetto finally got his Bugatti ready and he joined the race but over 5 laps behind Wimille.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":13,"text":"On the 13th lap there was an accident when the front wheel of Mme Mareuse's Bugatti collapsed during heavy braking.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":13,"text":"Two tyres burst and the car somersaulted throwing out Mme Mareuse, who was taken to hospital with facial injuries.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":15,"text":"Lehoux had to retire as well and then Delorme had a bad crash with his Bugatti that resulted in a broken rib and a hit on the head.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":17,"text":"Gaupillat retires from second with a broken half shaft; Wimille is left in total command.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":20,"text":"He was fastest driver on the track, passing car after car in his chase.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":30,"text":"He even seems to have managed to unlap himself, passing Wimille, to the applauses of the spectators.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":41,"text":"Three hours into the race the flag was dropped for the 14 remaining drivers. Wimille won by two laps followed by Zehender in the Monza and Joly and Veyron in the voiturette Maseratis.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":41,"text":"Trintignant was fifth and Falchetto had climbed all the way to sixth position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5}]}